WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.958
Compare the two ideas on screen: different roles and overlapping contributions. An

00:00:04.958 --> 00:00:09.917
assistant, office manager or chief of staff may contribute in different ways.

00:00:09.917 --> 00:00:14.875
These are not a universal ranking of jobs.

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:19.308
Now compare actual delegation with its specific conditions. Technical ability and a

00:00:19.308 --> 00:00:23.550
senior-sounding title do not create permission to approve a payment or make

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:27.792
a specialist decision.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.663
When a request crosses the actual mandate, identify the owner who can

00:00:33.663 --> 00:00:39.325
decide. Useful coordination can continue without pretending that authority has transferred.
